---
/**
 * Quantia — the case study, rebuilt.
 *
 * It replaced an earlier version of this page whose sections were drawn from a
 * different board; nothing of that one survives but the brand's palette, its
 * type and the Ubuntu files under `assets/quantia/ubuntu`.
 */
